## Context

PR #1075 imported eight skills the author had uploaded to claude.ai. The author judged it "a dump, not a careful merge": bodies were copied wholesale and only adjusted to pass gates. The claude.ai uploads were deleted by the author on 2026-10-01 and `syncClaudeAiSkills` is false, so the harness copies are the single source.

A read-only audit (2026-10-01) compared each against harness skills and rules. Findings: three of the imports are the largest bodies in the tree after gaze (critical-lit-review 1257 lines, slides-review 777, text-to-slides 388); reading-note's RDF export contradicts zotero-import; critical-lit-review carries a second reading-note template, unshipped scripts, heavy deps (BERTopic) and an iterative screen that contradicts the single pooled screen practice; slides-review restates `rules/doctype/slides.md`; conference-targeting repeats `commands/choose-journal.md` without its diamond-OA filter; applied-econ-writing is applied-micro doctrine outside the author's field; trigger collisions on "where to submit", "literature review", "submission", "review my slides".

## Author decisions (2026-10-01, verbatim choices)

- Slides toolchain: "Beamer default" — follow rules/doctype/slides.md; ODP via LibreOffice conversion; no python-pptx/odfpy until a talk needs them.
- applied-econ-writing: "Retire + article rule" — rules/doctype/article.md with Head's intro formula and Shapiro's question criteria; drop applied-micro identification, J-PAL grants, journal selection.
- Venue: "choose-venue skill" — one skill, journal mode default, conference mode from conference-targeting; diamond-OA values apply to both; retires the command and conference-targeting.
- critical-lit-review: "Drop both" — search defers to biblio-saturation; retire search_istex.py/download_pdfs.py (ISTEX stays the edm.md full-text step); drop computational corpus analysis.
- Defaults taken without asking: bodies in English with French trigger words; a reading note is stored as its own Zotero Document item through index-source; one child ticket and one PR per verdict.

## Children

0993 reading-note + critical-lit-review · 0994 slides · 0995 choose-venue · 0996 conference-submission-prep · 0997 applied-econ-writing → article rule · 0998 message-framing

Children touch README.md (generated catalog): merge serially and regenerate the catalog on each rebase, never hand-merge it.

## Exit criteria

- [ ] All six children closed.
- [ ] Integration review: no trigger collision left among the resulting skills and existing ones; every cross-reference between them resolves.
